WEBVTT

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:02.200
"Hey, good luck, stay out of trouble.
Don't come back to prison."

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:06.096
With no meaningful preparation
or long-term financial plan,

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.320
what does he do ... ?

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:09.800
At 60?

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.456
Get a good job,

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:16.400
or go back to the very criminal behavior
that led him to prison in the first place?

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.176
You taxpayers, you choose.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.360
Well, his education
already chose for him, probably.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.480
So how do we cure this disease?

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.976
I cofounded a program

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:32.576
that we call Financial Empowerment
Emotional Literacy.